OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSunny spells and variable cloud
OL,6,Faround to start. This cloud building
OL,7,Ffrom the northwest into the afternoon
OL,8,Fwith rain to follow. Feeling
OL,9,Funseasonably mild with blustery
OL,10,Fsouthwesterly winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FRain continuing through the
OL,13,Fevening and overnight, sometimes
OL,14,Fheavy. Clearing to the southeast into
OL,15,Fthe early hours. Feeling noticeably
OL,16,Fcooler behind the rain, with lighter
OL,17,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
